<title>USA: Hutchinson Technology offers common shares.</title>
<headline>Hutchinson Technology offers common shares.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Minn. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Technology Inc Wednesday announced a public offer of nearly 3.4 million common shares for $36 each.</p>
<p>Hutchinson said it will offer three million shares, while 375,000 shares will be sold by its stockholders.</p>
<p>The company plans to use proceeds from the sale for manufacturing and support equipment and continuing construction of a new phototech facility.</p>
<p>Hutchinson makes suspension assemblies for computer disk drives.</p>
<p>Its shares closed down 7/8 Wednesday at 37-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
